---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base
  title="Things I've Explored"
  description="New experiences, unfamiliar places, incredible stories, and worlds worth getting lost in."
>
  <header class="page-hero">
    <p class="eyebrow">Things I've Explored</p>
    <h1 class="wide-title">There's always more out there.</h1>
    <div class="lede">
      <p>
        New experiences, unfamiliar places, incredible stories, and worlds worth getting lost in. Some I've discovered, some I keep returning to, and plenty are still waiting.
      </p>
    </div>
  </header>

  <div class="chapters section">
    <section>
      <p class="kicker">01 · Experiences</p>
      <h2>For the thrill of trying.</h2>
      <div class="prose">
        <p>
          From skydiving and scuba diving to flying lessons, dancing, and spontaneous adventures. There's something exciting about discovering what an experience feels like for yourself.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section>
      <p class="kicker">02 · Outdoors</p>
      <h2>There's always another trail.</h2>
      <div class="prose">
        <p>
          Quiet trails, unfamiliar paths, beautiful views, and the simple joy of being outside. Sometimes the journey is just as rewarding as the destination.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section>
      <p class="kicker">03 · Stories & worlds</p>
      <h2>A thousand worlds to explore.</h2>
      <div class="prose">
        <p>
          Books, games, mythology, history, fantasy, and the stories that make you want to keep discovering more.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>

  <a class="pager" href="/notes">
    <small>Next</small>
    <span>Notes</span>
  </a>
</Base>
